 "notes": "Dive area at the Schurinkshof steiger on the south side of Bussloo: a guide line joins the bandenrif, the bouwsteiger (6.5 m), the two buses, the little boat wreck, platforms, the onderwaterhuis, the Kees Knol monument and the car at 10.5 m, on the OpenStreetMap shoreline; positions and the 5 and 10 m contours are approximate. The site point sits in a car park about 900 m south-east of the steiger.",
